sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SM as ScanManager
    participant R as oobReceiver(单例)
    participant O as OobDetector
    participant DB as 目标 DBMS
    participant H as HttpClient

    Note over SM,R: 启动阶段：oob 选中且 enabled
    SM->>R: R.start(config.oob)  // 独立 HTTP 端口，幂等
    R-->>SM: 监听 GET /oob/:id

    Note over SM,O: 调度阶段：detectors 末位，前面均未命中才到达
    SM->>O: detect(ctx)  // ctx.dbms 可能已知
    O->>O: 生成 token(nanoid)
    O->>O: callback = config.oob.callbackBase + "/oob/" + token
    O->>O: 选 OOB_PAYLOADS[dbms] 填 {CALLBACK}（不做 tamper）
    O->>H: 注入触发带外 payload（经 HttpClient）
    H->>DB: 目标执行 → 尝试回连 callbackBase
    O->>R: waitForToken(token, config.oob.timeoutMs)
    alt 目标回连 / 测试直接调 R.receive(token)
        DB-->>R: GET /oob/:token
        R-->>O: 收到 → waitForToken 返回 true
        O-->>SM: DetectionResult{vulnerable:true, technique:'oob', dbms}
    else 超时
        R-->>O: 返回 false
        O-->>SM: DetectionResult{vulnerable:false}
    end

---

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant D as Detector / Extractor
    participant O as obfuscateWithConfig
    participant Reg as TamperRegistry
    participant H as HttpClient

    D->>O: obfuscateWithConfig(payload, ctx)
    alt config.wafEvasion.tamper.enabled
        O->>Reg: resolve(plugins) → 有序插件数组
        Reg-->>O: 插件链
        loop 链式 transform
            O->>O: p = plugin.transform(p, ctx)
        end
        O-->>D: 混淆后 payload
    else config.wafEvasion.obfuscate (legacy)
        O->>O: obfuscatePayload(payload)  // 现状行为，向后兼容
        O-->>D: 混淆后 payload
    else 均未开
        O-->>D: 原样 payload
    end
    D->>H: send(request)

---

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SM as ScanManager
    participant TP as TargetParser(httpClient)
    participant H as HttpClient
    participant TG as 目标页 / action 页

    SM->>TP: await parser.discover(target)  // 改为 async
    TP->>TP: 原有 4 类参数发现(url/body/cookie/header) 不变
    alt config.crawlForms === true
        TP->>H: GET baseUrl
        H->>TG: 请求页面
        TG-->>TP: HTML
        TP->>TP: 解析 <form>，提取 input(含 hidden/CSRF)
        TP->>H: GET action 指向页(如有)
        TP->>TP: 生成 body 位置表单点(独立 action=独立点)
        Note over TP: csrfTokenName 命中正则则记录；formValues 全量保留
    end
    TP-->>SM: InjectionPoint[]（含表单点）
